<title>USA: Millipore Q1 shr loss $2.25 with charges.</title>
<headline>Millipore Q1 shr loss $2.25 with charges.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD, Mass. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p>	  3  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.25   profit	 $0.57</p>
<p> Net loss		  97,762   profit	25,233</p>
<p> Revs		     178,839		  156,476</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  43,391		   44,163</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Quarters ended March 31. The 1997 quarter includes a pre-tax non-cash charge of $119 million, or $2.73 a share after tax, mostly for the write-off of in-process research and and development associated with the acquisition of Tylan General in Jan.  Without those costs, Q1 earnings would have been $0.48 per share.</p>
</text>
